## 5. Prerequisites

- **Operating System:** Windows 11 64-bit.
- **Python:** CPython 3.10.10 64-bit ([python.org](https://www.python.org/downloads/release/python-31010/)).
- **Processor:** Intel Core i5/i7/i9 (10th Gen+) or AMD Ryzen (3000+) supporting AVX2.
